    "body": {
      "en": "### Week 1: Sun, Shade and Cool Bodies\n\nChildren meet summer care routines through hats, water, towels, shade mats, cooling movements, puppet care, sun and shade art, and safe staying-near routines.\n\n### Week 2: Water Play and Pouring\n\nChildren explore controlled water play through pouring, scooping, wiping, drying, gentle hands, water rhythm, toy care, and clean-up routines.\n\n### Week 3: Summer Fruits and Picnic Play\n\nChildren join picnic contexts through fruit props, cups, napkins, baskets, shared mats, pretend friends, rhythm circles, group helping, and simple give-and-receive routines.\n\n### Week 4: Beach, Garden and Summer Care\n\nChildren revisit summer materials through beach and garden small worlds, texture boards, movement paths, safe body routines, buckets, stones, leaves, shells, tools, and material return.\n\n---",
      "zh": ""
    },
